  "details": "When taking a photo with the Gallery camera in VR, and then applying it, and then selecting it as a profile picture:\nObserved:\n- The image is cropped to be smaller than the preview picture prior to saving\n- The image is square\n- Applying the image as a profile picture results in either a squished picture or a further cropped picture\nExpected:\n- The image should match the area chosen when applying the picture\n- The image should not be square\n- The displayed profile picture should match the original picture without deformation or cropping\nAttached:\n- A square picture taken in 1137 (with cropped text, which shouldn't have been)\n- A normal picture taken in live",
